repository-code: "https://github.com/webdevsamran/local-ai-hardware-bench"
url: "https://github.com/webdevsamran/local-ai-hardware-bench"
abstract: >-
  A vendor-neutral, reproducible framework for evaluating local AI runtimes
  across CPUs, GPUs, NPUs, AI PCs, workstations, mini PCs, and edge
  accelerators. Results include full environment capture, are validated
  against a versioned schema, and are privacy-sanitized before publication.
